{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/en/ep1/quest_story/11107030.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110703001:1":{"text":"Brutus... Do you honestly think you'd lose to Alsa and me in a fair fight right now?","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人。您认为此时此刻，在一场公平的决斗中，您会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF76180E9FA6F6B4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110703002:1":{"text":"I've never considered it in that way. You are both forces to be reckoned with at your age.","source_cn":"我从未那么想过。索恩，阿尔萨，你们是你们这个年纪的强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4F7C6F2FCBB041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110703003:1":{"text":"But perfecting your battle instincts takes time. Experience is essential, it cannot be accomplished overnight.","source_cn":"但若想锤炼最完美的战斗直觉，经验必不可少，这绝非一朝一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3632331FAB21D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110703004:1":{"text":"We agree. We understand that winning this festival might be a bit too heavy a burden for us right now.","source_cn":"我们也是这么想的。战歌节胜者这一称号，对现在的我们来说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A95145AEF346EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110703005:1":{"text":"Yeah, even though we've secretly dreamed of it... But deep down, in everyone's hearts...","source_cn":"没错，虽然我们是有偷偷幻想过啦……但在我心中、在索恩心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EE809B19EA516BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110703006:1":{"text":"Brutus is the true champion. The desert's mightiest warrior!","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人，您才是当之无愧的胜者，是这片沙漠最强的战神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A61FED3F36D8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110703007:1":{"text":"... Until the next Warsong Festival.","source_cn":"……直到下下一届战歌节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B6D40D4735501E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1110703007":{"text":"... Until the next Warsong Festival.","source_cn":"……直到下下一届战歌节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B6D40D4735501E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110703008:1":{"text":"Well, I believe Brutus should know my true thoughts.","source_cn":"我想了想，还是希望布鲁特斯大人知道我的想法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC809434C5EB5BFCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110703009:1":{"text":"Alright, Soren and Alsa.","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈！好！索恩，阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CA28AF9D6DF794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110703010:1":{"text":"I'll hold onto first place until you're ready to take it from me!","source_cn":"我会替你们保留着战神之名，直到你们强到足够挑战我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345A5A94C8DE1BEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110703011:1":{"text":"That day will come sooner than you think!","source_cn":"会有那一天的。或许比您想得快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5EA7601815047B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110703012:1":{"text":"And remember when you asked us about our goals for joining the Warsong Festival? Well, we've achieved them now!","source_cn":"而且，您曾经问我和索恩参加战歌节的目的对吧？现在，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44F3A379FD8D57D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110703013:1":{"text":"That's right! The Uru Clan's name echoes across every corner of the desert now!","source_cn":"没错！现在，乌尔氏族的名声已经传遍了沙漠的每个角落！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70DBEABDC56E0212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110703014:1":{"text":"Whether they're Mikola's friends or folks who couldn't give a hoot about the festival, everyone's now buzzing about these two young warriors.","source_cn":"无论是不是曼卡拉的老朋友，甚至最不关心战歌节的人，也都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E9A9697F2CB468","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110703015:1":{"text":"Yesterday, they were nobodies, but today, they're heroes! Even the gods must love a tale like this, right?","source_cn":"昨日还是无名之辈，现在却成了英雄！恐怕连神都爱看这样的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1217D1D40BA21272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110703016:1":{"text":"Fair enough. Well then... Take care, you two. I've got some business to attend to, so I'll take my leave.","source_cn":"如此便好。那么……保重，索恩，阿尔萨。我有些事要处理，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0545C68FD823439A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110703017:1":{"text":"Goodbye, Brutus! And please, visit our clan when you have the chance!","source_cn":"保重，布鲁特斯大人！有机会请一定来我们氏族坐坐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF2FAF577219F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110703018:1":{"text":"Alsa, what are you spacing out for?","source_cn":"阿尔萨……喂，好端端地发什么愣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BE4617BA9A2333C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110703019:1":{"text":"Huh? Oh... It's kind of embarrassing, but just now, Brutus reminded me of Pops...","source_cn":"啊？哦……说来有点害臊，刚才布鲁特斯大人的样子，让我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE2CA879BF74C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110703020:1":{"text":"What was he like?","source_cn":"那是个怎样的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A313E6AC53D465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110703021:1":{"text":"Don't get the wrong idea! Our dad was just an average Mauler. You could've taken him out in three moves. I could probably even beat him as I am now.","source_cn":"您别误会！我们的老爹是个普通得不能再普通的蛮血。在您手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x522BA4E4AC4B598A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110703022:1":{"text":"But he was... the best person in the world. Soren, let's get back. I can't wait to share the news with Pops!","source_cn":"他只是……世界上最好的人，仅此而已。索恩，我们快点回去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072815F6ACBA1920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110703023:1":{"text":"Yes... Me too.","source_cn":"嗯……我也是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A9FBF559F437A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Was that necessary?","source_cn":"……还是说实话了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26BC4AD992DD605D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Was that necessary?","female":"Was that necessary?","variant_male_record_index":"63184","variant_female_record_index":"63185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"You never hold anything back.","source_cn":"有必要说这句吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x74F9DC1BAC61389A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You never hold anything back.","female":"You never hold anything back.","variant_male_record_index":"63186","variant_female_record_index":"63187","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"Brutus","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"Mikola","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":26,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/en/ep1/quest_story/11107031.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107031","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107031","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1110703101:0":{"text":"Soren! Soren! Alsa! Alsa!","source_cn":"阿尔萨！阿尔萨！索恩！索恩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCECAD2756A4C2F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110703102:0":{"text":"Welcome back!","source_cn":"我们的英雄们！欢迎回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64DE7D9BEE14DA85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血萨札":{"text":"Shayan","source":"小蛮血萨札","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小蛮血卡鲁恩":{"text":"Karun","source":"小蛮血卡鲁恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep1/quest_story/11107032.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107032","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107032","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1110703201:0":{"text":"The heroes of the Uru Clan have returned!","source_cn":"乌尔氏族的英雄们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D57B997FBE7CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110703202:0":{"text":"Our warriors!","source_cn":"勇士！勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80CBA4063E37E21B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110703203:0":{"text":"I missed you, Alsa!","source_cn":"阿尔萨！我好想你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9079AEC0AC43AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110703204:0":{"text":"You're the best, Soren!","source_cn":"索恩，太厉害了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA5DEE1B90F8F346","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血1":{"text":"Mauler Child A","source":"小蛮血1","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小蛮血2":{"text":"小蛮血2","source":"小蛮血2","status":"source"},"speaker:小蛮血3":{"text":"小蛮血3","source":"小蛮血3","status":"source"},"speaker:小蛮血4":{"text":"小蛮血4","source":"小蛮血4","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/en/ep1/quest_story/11107040.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107040","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110704001:1":{"text":"We're home! Were you worried sick while we were out? Were you absolutely starving without the good meat that I hunt?","source_cn":"回来啦回来啦！我跟索恩出去这么久，大家肚子饿不饿？真令...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D97FC3268636377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110704002:1":{"text":"Stop projecting, it seems like you're the one who's hungry!","source_cn":"我看是你饿了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AB07B499C2D07EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110704003:1":{"text":"Alsa, Soren! You're back!","source_cn":"阿尔萨，索恩！你们回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA1DB677365D07D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110704004:1":{"text":"We heard the news! Of the brave warriors from the Uru Clan who conquered all the trials!","source_cn":"我们都听说啦！通过了所有试炼和考验的乌尔氏族勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F492830ACA2B39B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110704005:1":{"text":"It's really you two! We thought it might be some other Soren and Alsa!","source_cn":"居然真的是我们的索恩和阿尔萨！还以为是叫同样名字的别人呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E53AC9133E4CF8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110704006:1":{"text":"Pft! There's no one else out there as cool as Soren and Alsa!","source_cn":"居然以为是别人！哪有那么多的索恩和阿尔萨啊……唔？这是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6271517FB7EA7231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110704007:1":{"text":"Alsa, you'll be happy to hear that we prepared an awesome feast for you two!","source_cn":"阿尔萨，不会以为我们连庆功宴都没给你们准备吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x042FBEB5B125A45C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110704008:1":{"text":"With all your favorite foods!! Grilled meat, soup, and... hold on, desserts are on the way!","source_cn":"全都是你们喜欢的食物！有烤肉，有汤……稍等，点心马上就来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF259EF3625F662C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110704009:0":{"text":"Wait a second! Where did all this come from?! I remember when we left, there was barely enough food to scrape by...","source_cn":"等等等等！这些东西是从哪里变出来的？记得我走的时候全部...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F043E97EBB6565D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110704010:1":{"text":"Well... We couldn't let you guys down!","source_cn":"我们……不能给阿尔萨和索恩拖后腿啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F6473E083AACBE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110704011:1":{"text":"Yeah! We might be young, but you were already taking care of us when you were our age.","source_cn":"没错。我们现在年纪虽小，但你们在像我这么大的时候，已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D2FB5D10A1E22B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110704012:1":{"text":"The Uru Clan is a clan full of heroes, and I wanna live up to the name!","source_cn":"我们乌尔氏族是出了英雄的氏族。只要想到这里，就觉得不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x353C4D9F32C0AD9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110704013:1":{"text":"And Soren, teach me how to hunt! I can definitely be helpful too!","source_cn":"我们也有我们能做的事！索恩，教我打猎吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97B0EDD2B48A1C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110704014:1":{"text":"You're still too young, kiddo. Hunting is dangerous. Let Alsa teach you how to set some traps instead.","source_cn":"你还太小，打猎危险。让阿尔萨教你做陷阱吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA985D7F15D14E2EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110704015:1":{"text":"Aww man! But I wanna go hunting!","source_cn":"呜呜！就要打猎就要打猎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD976B31CD666562F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110704016:1":{"text":"... Alright, but first you'll have to prove to me you can swing a club a hundred times.","source_cn":"……行吧。不过，要先等到你能挥棍一百下再说吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7C88880CF6A2B95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110704017:1":{"text":"Ah, it seems like Soren is also growing up. He's handling the kids so well.","source_cn":"居然开始和颜悦色？索恩也长大了呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEEE81FFF31FDD06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1110704017":{"text":"Ah, it seems like Soren is also growing up. He's handling the kids so well.","source_cn":"居然开始和颜悦色？索恩也长大了呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEEE81FFF31FDD06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110704018:1":{"text":"... I'm right here, you know.","source_cn":"……为什么连你也说这种话？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x289746801B401838","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... I'm right here, you know.","female":"... I'm right here, you know.","variant_male_record_index":"120873","variant_female_record_index":"120874","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110704019:1":{"text":"Soren wouldn't have reacted if it was anyone else saying that! But he acts differently around you, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"如果是别人这么说，索恩估计会转身就走了。不过，<sty...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1341039469236A2B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Soren wouldn't have reacted if it was anyone else saying that! But he acts differently around you, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"Soren wouldn't have reacted if it was anyone else saying that! But he acts differently around you, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"120875","variant_female_record_index":"120876","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110704020:1":{"text":"Ah, right. You seem to prefer to keep your identity hidden, so I'll keep calling you by that name, alright?","source_cn":"……你似乎不希望你的身份公开，所以我还是继续称呼你这个...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23BB282EC26A964F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Ah, right. You seem to prefer to keep your identity hidden, so I'll keep calling you by that name, alright?","female":"Ah, right. You seem to prefer to keep your identity hidden, so I'll keep calling you by that name, alright?","variant_male_record_index":"120877","variant_female_record_index":"120878","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1110704020":{"text":"Ah, right. You seem to prefer to keep your identity hidden, so I'll keep calling you by that name, alright?","source_cn":"……你似乎不希望你的身份公开，所以我还是继续称呼你这个名字吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23BB282EC26A964F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Ah, right. You seem to prefer to keep your identity hidden, so I'll keep calling you by that name, alright?","female":"Ah, right. You seem to prefer to keep your identity hidden, so I'll keep calling you by that name, alright?","variant_male_record_index":"120877","variant_female_record_index":"120878","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1110704021:1":{"text":"That's why we like you so much! You don't flaunt your position or anything. You're a really good person.","source_cn":"这么说是你的高贵之处。你不愿将对我们、对乌尔氏族的恩情...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB917A16D35904F5B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's why we like you so much! You don't flaunt your position or anything. You're a really good person.","female":"That's why we like you so much! You don't flaunt your position or anything. You're a really good person.","variant_male_record_index":"120879","variant_female_record_index":"120880","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1110704022:1":{"text":"Alsa and I may have limited abilities, but we'll always be there for our friends. If you ever need anything in the future, just ask.","source_cn":"我与阿尔萨能做到的事有限，但我们绝不愿意辜负朋友。今后...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35DD714C4F1AEF85","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Alsa and I may have limited abilities, but we'll always be there for our friends. If you ever need anything in the future, just ask.","female":"Alsa and I may have limited abilities, but we'll always be there for our friends. If you ever need anything in the future, just ask.","variant_male_record_index":"120881","variant_female_record_index":"120882","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1110704023:1":{"text":"The entire Uru Clan is at your service!","source_cn":"整个乌尔氏族也供你差遣！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4046BF2ED97A7700","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The entire Uru Clan is at your service!","female":"The entire Uru Clan is at your service!","variant_male_record_index":"120883","variant_female_record_index":"120884","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1110704024:1":{"text":"Mister Magister, have some of this yummy grilled meat!","source_cn":"魔法师大人，请吃这块汁水最多的烤肉吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1235454D1E344DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Mister Magister, have some of this yummy grilled meat!","female":"Miss Magister, have some of this yummy grilled meat!","variant_male_record_index":"120885","variant_female_record_index":"120886","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1110704025:1":{"text":"Right, let us eat first! After the meal, would you come with us to see Pops...? He said he wanted to be buried on the outskirts before he passed...","source_cn":"没错没错，先开饭！吃完饭之后，你也陪我们看看老爹吧……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x197576CB891C1C05","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Right, let us eat first! After the meal, would you come with us to see Pops...? He said he wanted to be buried on the outskirts before he passed...","female":"Right, let us eat first! After the meal, would you come with us to see Pops...? He said he wanted to be buried on the outskirts before he passed...","variant_male_record_index":"120887","variant_female_record_index":"120888","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"You don't have to be so formal.","source_cn":"我只是略尽绵力","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF404590CAE994E9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You don't have to be so formal.","female":"You don't have to be so formal.","variant_male_record_index":"63192","variant_female_record_index":"63193","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:1:2":{"text":"My friends can call me anything.","source_cn":"我只是帮助朋友","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE48AEE20B0968C2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"My friends can call me anything.","female":"My friends can call me anything.","variant_male_record_index":"63194","variant_female_record_index":"63195","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"What a surprise.","source_cn":"真是意外","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C090F391FBC7845","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What a surprise.","female":"What a surprise.","variant_male_record_index":"63188","variant_female_record_index":"63189","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:1:2":{"text":"Yes, he seems really mature.","source_cn":"成长很快啊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x669025D095B27CB8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes, he seems really mature.","female":"Yes, he seems really mature.","variant_male_record_index":"63190","variant_female_record_index":"63191","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小蛮血卡鲁恩":{"text":"Karun","source":"小蛮血卡鲁恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小蛮血萨札":{"text":"Shayan","source":"小蛮血萨札","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小蛮血哈米拉":{"text":"Hamira","source":"小蛮血哈米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":32,"localized_text_count":31,"speaker_count":5}},"locales/en/ep1/quest_story/11107041.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107041","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107041","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1110704101:0":{"text":"After everyone finishes eating...","source_cn":"众人吃完饭后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17448AE8010B8AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"Black Screen","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep1/quest_story/11107050.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1110705001:0":{"text":"He didn't want his grave to take up space where our people lived...","source_cn":"老爹临终前，让我们把他埋在边缘……他不愿让他的坟墓占据...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x022D1569705F69DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110705002:0":{"text":"... But it's not like our clan was that big back then.","source_cn":"……哪有那么多族人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E80656FF85C55FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110705003:0":{"text":"I'm sure he believed that the clan would thrive under your guidance.","source_cn":"那是因为他相信，乌尔氏族会在你们手中壮大吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB109474B42927AF8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm sure he believed that the clan would thrive under your guidance.","female":"I'm sure he believed that the clan would thrive under your guidance.","variant_male_record_index":"120892","variant_female_record_index":"120893","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110705004:0":{"text":"Hmm... It's only been a short while, but there's more gravel up there now... Let's clean it up...","source_cn":"嗯……才多久没来，上面就多了一些沙砾……我们清扫下吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC01CE5C925BA2D3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"Player","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/timeline/dialoguetree_story/11110890.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_11110890","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"11110890","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"subtitle:1:1110702001:":{"text":"Hurry up!","source_cn":"快点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x378FAC1FF2BE332C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702002:":{"text":"We're gonna be late!","source_cn":"我们要迟到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD168E0CC67C9354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702003:":{"text":"Now...","source_cn":"所以……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B079345397C935E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702004:":{"text":"Shall we begin the final match?","source_cn":"可以开始决赛了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x610EE26106C03B32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702005:":{"text":"No,","source_cn":"不，","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3303EFDF17E1C277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702006:":{"text":"There is no need for it.","source_cn":"不需要再比了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD751C2CE7B1D0199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702007:":{"text":"The winners have already been decided","source_cn":"胜者已经决出——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x221E911D8F896E2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702008:":{"text":"Alsa","source_cn":"阿尔萨<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB53EFAFB971DAA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:1:1110702009:":{"text":"Soren","source_cn":"索恩<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF958AA00F57D6055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"